// Premises fix x to z; AC argument ordering must not invent a different mapping.
theory DiffVariantACAlignment begin
builtins: multiset, symmetric-encryption
rule R: [In(x), In(y), In(x ++ y), In(k)] --> [Out(sdec(senc(x,k),k))]
left rule R: [In(x), In(y), In(x ++ y), In(k)] --> [Out(sdec(senc(x,k),k))]
 variants rule (modulo AC) R___VARIANT_1: [In(z), In(y), In(z ++ y), In(k)] --> [Out(z)]
right rule R: [In(x), In(y), In(x ++ y), In(k)] --> [Out(sdec(senc(x,k),k))]
end
